# Chameha

Chameha is the **voice, personality, conversation engine, and execution interface** of **SORABBYNGO OS**.

It is the first intelligence users interact with. Every request—whether spoken, typed, or triggered automatically—passes through Chameha.

Chameha understands intent, maintains conversations, plans actions through **AION**, delegates reasoning to **Byngox**, communicates through **Byngonet**, and safely executes operations on the operating system.

Unlike traditional voice assistants, Chameha is an operating system component rather than an application.

